  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"11a\"><p><strong>11a</strong></p><p></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"_{\\, \\, \\, 90}^{231}\\textrm{Th} \\rightarrow _{\\, \\, \\, 89}^{231}\\textrm{Ac} + _{+1}^{\\, \\, \\, \\, 0}\\textrm{e} + _{0}^{0}\\textrm{}{v}_{e}\"></span></p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"11b\"><p><strong>11b</strong></p><p></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25-26\"></span> hours</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"11c\"><p><strong>11c</strong></p><p> </p>\n<p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure>\n</p>\n<p> </p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"11d\"><p><strong>11d</strong></p><p></p>\n<p>Mass of thorium in the sample after two days: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"160\"></span> g</p>\n<p>The atomic mass of thorium in this sample is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"231\"></span> g</p>\n<p>Number of moles of thorium nuclides after two days: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{160}{231} \\approx 0.693\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"N = (6.02 \\times 10^{23})(0.693) \\approx 4.2 \\times 10^{23}\"></span></p>\n<p> </p></section>"
