  "paper": "paper_2",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Thorium decays into actinium through positive beta <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"(\\beta^{+})\"></span> decay. </p>\n<p>a. Complete the equation for this decay.</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"_{\\square}^{\\square}\\textrm{Th} \\rightarrow _{\\, \\, \\, 89}^{231}\\textrm{Ac} + _{\\square}^{\\square}\\textrm{e} + \\square\"></span></p>\n<p>   [2]</p>\n<p>The graph shows how the mass of thorium remaining in a sample varies with time.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>b. State the half-life of thorium.</p>\n<p>   [1]</p>\n<p>c. Sketch on the graph how the mass of actinium varies with time in the sample.</p>\n<p>   [2]</p>\n<p>d. Estimate the number of thorium nuclides in the sample after two days.</p>\n<p>  [2]</p>"
  },
